        "question_wpikKM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the Nutritional Information for Ground and Whole Bean Happy Bear Coffee?",
            "answer": "<p>The ingredients are as follows: 100% Arabica Coffee, Natural & Artificial Flavors. Since flavors are proprietary (means it's top secret information) we do not provide a more extensive breakdown. The FDA only requires that the major allergens (Milk, Dairy, Eggs, Wheat, Gluten, Tree Nuts, Peanuts, Soy, Fish, Shellfish) are disclosed if present. None of our ground or whole bean coffees contain any of these allergens.</p>"
          }
